WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.431 --> 00:00:04.921
Unit seventeen. Understanding Software Updates!

2
00:00:05.885 --> 00:00:10.398
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emily, your technology teacher.

3
00:00:10.448 --> 00:00:13.491
Hi, Ms. Emily! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:13.541 --> 00:00:18.088
Today we learn about Understanding Software Updates. Let's go!

5
00:00:19.599 --> 00:00:24.556
Software update. Say it with me. Software update!

6
00:00:27.997 --> 00:00:31.758
Patch. Say it with me. Patch!

7
00:00:35.299 --> 00:00:39.799
New feature. Say it with me. New feature!

8
00:00:43.323 --> 00:00:47.790
Bug fix. Say it with me. Bug fix!

9
00:00:51.225 --> 00:00:56.692
Security improvement. Say it with me. Security improvement!

10
00:01:00.275 --> 00:01:04.641
Install. Say it with me. Install!

11
00:01:08.102 --> 00:01:11.689
Version. Say it with me. Version!

12
00:01:15.180 --> 00:01:18.992
Current. Say it with me. Current!

13
00:01:22.502 --> 00:01:32.713
A software update, sometimes called a patch, provides a new feature, bug fix... / security improvement. I install an update to stay on the current version.

14
00:01:32.763 --> 00:01:35.909
Now I understand. Thank you, Ms. Emily!

15
00:01:36.640 --> 00:01:42.100
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:42.150 --> 00:01:43.418
New feature!

17
00:01:44.419 --> 00:01:49.792
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:49.842 --> 00:01:50.992
Version!

19
00:01:51.934 --> 00:01:59.811
Did you know? Software updates often fix security problems that could otherwise let hackers access a device!

20
00:01:59.861 --> 00:02:02.300
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:02:03.251 --> 00:02:15.287
Think and answer. Why might it be important to install a security-related software update quickly?

22
00:02:15.337 --> 00:02:16.663
Great answer!

23
00:02:17.389 --> 00:02:23.235
Great job today! Keep learning, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:23.285 --> 00:02:26.639
Goodbye, everyone! See you next time!

